  "sentences": [
    {
      "en": "\nHafiz: Can you believe that an event of such importance occurred as claimed by you and that none of\nthe prominent ulama’ have reported it?",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": "\nWell-Wisher: I did not expect such a statement from you.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": " The Ghadir al-Khum affair is as clear as day\nand no one but a bigoted and obstinate person would invite ignominy by denying such an event.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": " This\nimportant matter has been recorded by all your pious ulama’ in their authentic books.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": " I should like to\nmention here some of the names of the authors and their books so that you may know that all your\neminent ulama’ have relied on this hadith.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": "\n1.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": " Imam Fakhru'd-Din Razi - Tafsir al-Kabir Mafatihu'l-Ghaib.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": "\n2.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": " Imam Ahmad Tha'labi - Tafsir al-Kashfu'l-Bayan.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": "\n3.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": " Jalalu'd-Din Suyuti - Tafsir al-Durru'l-Manthur.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": "\n4.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": " Abu'l-Hasan ‘Ali Ibn Ahmad Wahidi Nishapuri - Asbabu'n- Nuzul.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": "\n5.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
